{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122427","id":4282802590,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_RmGe","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122427","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122427.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122427.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122427","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122427/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122427/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122427/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d6fa866fc2a8cc662e3690d1ded0770405273fa3","number":122427,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add basic mouse camera controls template to the CharacterBody3D ","user":{"login":"xam3adev","id":305113226,"node_id":"U_kgDOEi-oig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305113226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev","html_url":"https://github.com/xam3adev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe default \"CharacterBody3D\" movement template provides basic movement, gravity, and jumping, but it does not include mouse camera controls.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds basic mouse-look controls template, allowing the player to:\r\n\r\nRotate the character horizontally using the mouse.\r\nRotate the camera vertically using the mouse.\r\nLimit the vertical camera rotation to prevent unnatural rotation.\r\nCapture the mouse when the scene starts.\r\nRelease the mouse using the Escape key.\r\nThis provides a more complete starting point for FPS/TPS-style 3D projects without requiring users to implement basic mouse camera controls themselves.\r\n\r\nAdditional information\r\n\r\nThe camera is accessed as a child of the \"CharacterBody3D\", so the template expects a \"Camera3D\" node as part of the character setup.\r\n\r\nMouse sensitivity is exposed as a variable so it can be easily adjusted by the user.\r\n\r\nAI was used during the development of this contribution to help understand the existing Godot script template and assist with implementing the mouse camera control logic. The final changes were reviewed and adapted manually.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-14T20:00:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T20:55:51Z","closed_at":"2026-08-14T20:17:15Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1213d4243456607fd2343024e9259442c9a7a4e8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"xam3adev:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":1334526159,"node_id":"R_kgDOT4tAzw","name":"godot","full_name":"xam3adev/godot","owner":{"login":"xam3adev","id":305113226,"node_id":"U_kgDOEi-oig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305113226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users